You keep a special stash of [8, 12, 15, 17, 20 (TL1-5)] throwing knives in your bandolier, which you can throw all at once at enemies within a radius 5 cone, for [34%, 49%, 58%, 64%, 69% (TL1-5)] damage each.

Each target can be hit up to 5 times, if the number of knives exceeds the number of enemies.  Creatures block knives from hitting targets behind them.
